{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 🧠🤖 每日学习 | 第2周·Day4 ⚡\n",
    "\n",
    "## 💻 今日实战：NumPy实现Self-Attention\n",
    "\n",
    "🎯 **任务目标**：用50行NumPy代码从零实现Self-Attention机制，不依赖任何深度学习框架！\n",
    "\n",
    "这是理解Transformer核心的关键一步。通过亲手实现，你会真正明白注意力是如何工作的。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"🎉 环境准备完成！NumPy、Matplotlib、Seaborn已就绪\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 📝 Step 1: 创建测试数据\n",
    "\n",
    "我们先创建一个简单的句子表示，用随机矩阵模拟embedding向量。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 创建测试数据\n",
    "seq_len = 5  # 句子长度（5个词）\n",
    "d_model = 8  # 每个词的维度\n",
    "\n",
    "# 随机初始化embedding矩阵\n",
    "X = np.random.randn(seq_len, d_model)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"📊 输入数据形状: {X.shape}\")\n",
    "print(\"\\n📝 原始embedding矩阵：\")\n",
    "print(X)\n",
    "print(f\"\\n🔍 解释：{seq_len}个词，每个词用{d_model}维向量表示\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 📝 Step 2: 初始化注意力参数\n",
    "\n",
    "创建Q、K、V三个投影矩阵，这是自注意力的核心参数。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 初始化参数\n",
    "d_k = 4  # Q和K的维度\n",
    "d_v = 4  # V的维度\n",
    "\n",
    "# 随机初始化权重矩阵\n",
    "W_q = np.random.randn(d_model, d_k)  # Q投影权重\n",
    "W_k = np.random.randn(d_model, d_k)  # K投影权重\n",
    "W_v = np.random.randn(d_model, d_v)  # V投影权重\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"📊 权重矩阵形状：\")\n",
    "print(f\"Q权重: {W_q.shape} (将{d_model}维 → {d_k}维)\")\n",
    "print(f\"K权重: {W_k.shape} (将{d_model}维 → {d_k}维)\")\n",
    "print(f\"V权重: {W_v.shape} (将{d_model}维 → {d_v}维)\")\n",
    "print(\"\\n🔑 核心概念：Q=Query, K=Key, Value\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 📝 Step 3: 计算Q、K、V\n",
    "\n",
    "使用矩阵乘法计算Query、Key、Value向量。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 计算Q, K, V\n",
    "Q = np.dot(X, W_q)  # Query矩阵\n",
    "K = np.dot(X, W_k)  # Key矩阵\n",
    "V = np.dot(X, W_v)  # Value矩阵\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"📊 Q, K, V矩阵形状：\")\n",
    "print(f\"Query (Q): {Q.shape}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Key (K): {K.shape}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Value (V): {V.shape}\")\n",
    "print(\"\\n📝 Query矩阵示例（第一个词的query向量）：\")\n",
    "print(Q[0])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 📝 Step 4: 计算注意力分数\n",
    "\n",
    "这是最关键的一步：计算每个词对所有词的注意力分数！"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 计算注意力分数\n",
    "attention_scores = np.dot(Q, K.T)  # Q × K^T\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"📊 注意力分数矩阵形状: {attention_scores.shape}\")\n",
    "print(\"\\n📝 注意力分数矩阵（显示前3×3）：\")\n",
    "print(attention_scores[:3, :3])\n",
    "print(\"\\n🔍 解释：第i行第j列表示第i个词对第j个词的注意力分数\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 📝 Step 5: 缩放与归一化\n",
    "\n",
    "加入缩放因子（Scale）防止梯度消失，然后用softmax归一化。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 缩放因子\n",
    "scale_factor = 1.0 / np.sqrt(d_k)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 缩放注意力分数\n",
    "scaled_scores = attention_scores * scale_factor\n",
    "\n",
    "# Softmax归一化\n",
    "def softmax(x):\n",
    "    exp_x = np.exp(x - np.max(x, axis=-1, keepdims=True))\n",
    "    return exp_x / np.sum(exp_x, axis=-1, keepdims=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "attention_weights = softmax(scaled_scores)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"📊 缩放因子: {scale_factor}\")\n",
    "print(\"\\n📝 注意力权重矩阵（显示前3×3）：\")\n",
    "print(attention_weights[:3, :3])\n",
    "print(\"\\n🔍 每行和为1，表示注意力权重的概率分布\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 📝 Step 6: 计算最终输出\n",
    "\n",
    "用注意力权重加权求和Value向量，得到最终的Self-Attention输出！"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 计算最终输出\n",
    "output = np.dot(attention_weights, V)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"📊 最终输出形状: {output.shape}\")\n",
    "print(\"\\n📝 最终输出矩阵：\")\n",
    "print(output)\n",
    "print(\"\\n🎉 完整的Self-Attention实现完成！\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 📊 可视化注意力权重\n",
    "\n",
    "让我们可视化注意力权重矩阵，直观理解注意力分布。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 创建可视化\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 6))\n",
    "\n",
    "# 注意力权重热力图\n",
    "plt.subplot(1, 2, 1)\n",
    "sns.heatmap(attention_weights, annot=True, cmap='YlOrRd', \n",
    "            xticklabels=['词1', '词2', '词3', '词4', '词5'],\n",
    "            yticklabels=['词1', '词2', '词3', '词4', '词5'])\n",
    "plt.title('Self-Attention权重矩阵')\n",
    "plt.xlabel('Key (关注的目标词)')\n",
    "plt.ylabel('Query (当前词)')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 每个词的注意力权重分布\n",
    "plt.subplot(1, 2, 2)\n",
    "plt.bar(range(seq_len), attention_weights[0], alpha=0.7, label='词1')\n",
    "plt.bar(range(seq_len), attention_weights[1], alpha=0.7, label='词2')\n",
    "plt.bar(range(seq_len), attention_weights[2], alpha=0.7, label='词3')\n",
    "plt.xlabel('目标词位置')\n",
    "plt.ylabel('注意力权重')\n",
    "plt.title('不同词的注意力分布')\n",
    "plt.legend()\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🎯 验证与总结\n",
    "\n",
    "### ✅ 验证要点\n",
    "1. 检查注意力权重每行和是否为1\n",
    "2. 确认输出维度与输入维度匹配\n",
    "3. 观察注意力模式是否合理\n",
    "\n",
    "### 💡 关键理解\n",
    "1. **Query**: 当前词要关注什么\n",
    "2. **Key**: 被关注词的身份标识\n",
    "3. **Value**: 被关注词的实际内容\n",
    "4. **注意力权重**: Query与Key匹配的程度\n",
    "\n",
    "这个简单的实现包含了完整的Self-Attention机制！"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 验证注意力权重和\n",
    "row_sums = np.sum(attention_weights, axis=1)\",
    "print(f\"📊 每行注意力权重和（应该接近1）：\")\n",
    "print(row_sums)\n",
    "print(f\"\\n✅ 最大误差: {np.max(np.abs(row_sums - 1)):.6f}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 验证维度匹配\n",
    "print(f\"\\n✅ 输入维度: {X.shape}\")\n",
    "print(f\"✅ 输出维度: {output.shape}\")\n",
    "print(f\"✅ 维度匹配: {X.shape == output.shape}\")"
   ]
  }
 ],
